<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Bearing shame and scoffing rude,</l><l>In my place condemned He stood;</l><l>Sealed my pardon with His blood;</l><l>Hallelujah! what a Savior!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Guilty, vile, and helpless, we,</l><l>Spotless Lamb of God was He;</l><l>Full redemption—can it be?</l><l>Hallelujah! what a Savior!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lifted up was He to die,</l><l>“It is finished!” was His cry;</l><l>Now in heaven exalted high;</l><l>Hallelujah! what a Savior!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>When He comes, our glorious King,</l><l>To His kingdom us to bring,</l><l>Then anew this song we’ll sing</l><l>Hallelujah! what a Savior!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
